{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然だけどさ、おいしいよね！\n名古屋行ったら小倉トースト関連のお菓子買う\nって決めてる！\nこれは名古屋個別の帰りに買ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう\n昨日は乃木どこ見た？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっきりは\nそう簡単にやるものじゃないね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんなんか\nどっきりやったことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、また予告に\n中田うつってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告要員()かどうか\nみなさんも確認するために\n来週もまた見てね！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっきりしかけた？しかけられた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n放送されなかったところでいうと\nからし入りシュークリームのどっきりを\nしかけられて\nそのあと逆にしかけました！(*｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BabyCocoと生田絵梨花どっちが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうちのBabyCocoへの愛の大きさを\n知ってるでしょ？\nもちろん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりか様だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヲタ卒予定ある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nない！｀・ω・´キリッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレやプレゼント\nちょくちょくいただいてます！\nほんとにありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレの内容は\nちょいちょい中田から話ふる事あるから\n書いたことなんとなくは覚えておいてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで知ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいに思われたら病む←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプを真剣に読んでる生駒ちゃんを\n掴んでみた(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/16/7436651/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ、\nまたあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}